      "name": "Isindu Mj",
      "created_at": "2025-11-07T09:29:14.760Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I needs to rename the attendance status “Work from Home” to “Work on Sunday”. When I tried to do it by customizing the option values of the status field in the attendance form, it give the following error.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/6/9640f3c08de0d2acc0c9b919313a70cdf101dafc.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/9640f3c08de0d2acc0c9b919313a70cdf101dafc\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/6/9640f3c08de0d2acc0c9b919313a70cdf101dafc.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"lrcMm1bcCdnM3ClONt0oiwZABGc\" width=\"633\" height=\"112\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">633×112 3.23 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>So, how can I rename this?</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/isindumj/{size}/90058_2.png",
      "trust_level": 1,
