      "created_at": "2025-11-07T12:31:32.693Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If you only want to rename it, you could try using the “Translation” DocType to rename “Work from Home” to “Work on Sunday”.</p>\n<p>Apart from that, I don’t think there exists a way to rename it without affecting related functions.</p>",
